flowchart TD
    A[Public Restaurant / Menu / 3D] --> B{Customer logged in?}
    B -- No --> C[Customer Login with safe returnTo]
    B -- Yes --> D[FavouriteButton]
    D --> E[Optimistic local state]
    E --> F[/api/customer/favorites]
    F --> G[authenticateUser + requireCustomer]
    G --> H[customerController]
    H --> I[customerAccountService]
    I --> J{Target type}
    J -- Restaurant --> K[Validate active Restaurant]
    J -- menu_item --> L[Validate active + available dish and active Restaurant]
    K --> M[(Favorite)]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Return canonical favourites]
    N --> O[Replace optimistic state]
    F -- failure --> P[Rollback previous state]

    Q[/dashboard/] --> R[GET /api/customer/dashboard]
    R --> S[Counts + next reservation + profile]
    T[/dashboard/favourites/] --> U[Saved Restaurants + Saved Dishes]
    V[/dashboard/profile/] --> W[PATCH name + phone]
    X[/dashboard/reservations/] --> Y[Existing reservation history/cancel]
